### 1️⃣ **지수 백오프 재시도 로직 강화**
```java
// VectorSearchFunction.java 수정 권장
int maxRetries = 5;
long initialDelay = 1000; // 1초
long maxDelay = 32000;    // 32초

for (int attempt = 0; attempt < maxRetries; attempt++) {
    try {
        return bedrockClient.invokeModel(request);
    } catch (ServiceUnavailableException e) {
        long delay = Math.min(initialDelay * (long)Math.pow(2, attempt), maxDelay);
        Thread.sleep(delay);
    }
}
```

